@startuml login_lockout_progressive
title Progressive lockout (default: 3 failures per window, 9 total)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #444444
}

[*] --> NoRow : No row / failed_attempts = 0

NoRow --> Failing : Wrong PIN\nrecord_failure()

Failing --> Failing : Wrong PIN\n(1st or 2nd in group of 3)

Failing --> Locked15 : 3rd failure (tier 0)\nlocked_until = now + 15 min

Locked15 --> NoRow : Lock expires\nor cleanup_expired()\nor successful login reset()

Locked15 --> Failing : Wrong PIN after unlock\n(counter continues)

Failing --> Locked30 : 6th failure (tier 1)\nlocked_until = now + 30 min

Locked30 --> NoRow : Expired / reset

Failing --> PermLocked : 9th failure\npermanently_locked = true

PermLocked --> MustResetPin : admin_unlock()\nmust_reset_pin = true

MustResetPin --> NoRow : POST /atm/reset-pin\ncomplete_pin_reset()

note right of Locked30
  **LOCKOUT_MAX_ATTEMPTS** = 3
  **LOCKOUT_MINUTES** = [15, 30]
  2 timed tiers, then permanent lock
end note

note right of MustResetPin
  See **Figure 17** (sequence)
  and **Figure 18** (recovery states).
end note

@enduml
